1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,140
Olmos noyob emas.

2
00:00:02,140 --> 00:00:04,790
Senga shunday deb aytishgan.

3
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:08,080
Usta, to'yga olmos uzuk olaman!

4
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:14,330
Sevgilimga olmos uzukni berib, sevgim qanchalik kuchli ekanini isbotlayman!

5
00:00:14,330 --> 00:00:17,220
Lekin pulim yetmaydi, kredit olaman!

6
00:00:17,670 --> 00:00:21,690
Diyor, kim aytdi sevgi olmosda deb?

7
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:23,550
Hamma biladi-ku!

8
00:00:23,550 --> 00:00:25,680
Kinoda ham, reklamada ham.

9
00:00:26,330 --> 00:00:28,960
Diyor, eshit.

10
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:32,250
1938-yil, Amerika.

11
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:39,860
Dunyodagi eng katta olmos kompaniyasi reklama agentligini yollaydi.

12
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:40,690
Vazifa:

13
00:00:40,690 --> 00:00:44,870
odamlar olmosni sevgi belgisi deb o'ylasin.

14
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:45,990
1947-yil.

15
00:00:45,990 --> 00:00:49,710
Bitta shior yoziladi:

16
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:52,040
«Olmos — abadiy».

17
00:00:52,040 --> 00:01:00,900
Keyin bu asrning eng mashhur reklama shiori deb tan olindi.

18
00:01:01,350 --> 00:01:03,420
Yo'q, mumkin emas!

19
00:01:03,420 --> 00:01:04,660
Shiormi?!

20
00:01:05,310 --> 00:01:10,240
Televizorda, gazetada, kinoda — har joyda:

21
00:01:10,240 --> 00:01:13,520
uzuk olmosli bo'lsin, deyishdi.

22
00:01:13,520 --> 00:01:16,150
Keyinroq reklama aytdi:

23
00:01:16,150 --> 00:01:20,420
uzukka ikki oylik maoshingni sarfla.

24
00:01:21,070 --> 00:01:23,510
Sen sevgi sotib olmayapsan.

25
00:01:23,510 --> 00:01:25,400
Kredit sotib olyapsan.

26
00:01:26,050 --> 00:01:30,700
Demak, sevgilim olmosni emas, meni xohlaydi?

27
00:01:31,360 --> 00:01:32,290
Inshaalloh.

28
00:01:34,360 --> 00:01:35,170
Uchta savol.

29
00:01:35,170 --> 00:01:37,820
Bu uzukni kreditsiz ola olasanmi?

30
00:01:37,820 --> 00:01:39,860
To'ydan keyin necha oy to'laysan?

31
00:01:39,860 --> 00:01:42,100
Sevgiling bilan birga gaplashdingmi?

32
00:01:42,750 --> 00:01:49,730
Ular senga tosh emas, «sevgi shu narxda» degan tuyg'uni sotadi.

33
00:01:49,730 --> 00:01:51,060
Har gal so'ra:

34
00:01:51,060 --> 00:01:53,720
bundan kim foyda ko'radi?

35
00:01:54,370 --> 00:01:57,620
To'y xarajatlaringiz ro'yxatini botimizga yozing:

36
00:01:57,620 --> 00:01:58,580
@sahiychishopbot.

37
00:01:58,580 --> 00:02:04,320
Jamini va kreditning ortiqcha to'lovini hisoblab, qayerda tejash mumkinligini aytadi.

